  "sn22.89:5.7": "",
  "sn22.89:5.8": "",
  "sn22.89:5.9": "The key difference here is between “I am” (<i lang='pi' translate='no'>asmi</i>), the intuitive sense of being someone, and “I am that” (<i lang='pi' translate='no'>ayamahamasmi</i>), the identification of that someone with something in particular, namely the aggregates (see <a href='https://suttacentral.net/mn47/en/sujato#13.4'>MN 47:13.4</a> and note). | Read <i lang='pi' translate='no'>avigataṁ</i> per <a href='https://suttacentral.net/sn22.47/en/sujato#2.1'>SN 22.47:2.1</a>. ",
